    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
    "panels": [
      {
        "text": "[SAM]:  ..We survived. WE SURVIVED. Do you know how many scoops I just did?? I didn't look at the window ONCE.",
        "imageUrl": "",
        "key": "undefined-e0a9bcf5-aa9e-443d-a879-725e04f602e9",
        "typing": true,
        "layout": "text-bottom-center",
        "fadeInOverPrevious": false
      },
      {
        "text": "[SAM]: You know what you actually did today? You gave an AI a goal, tools, and rules. You watched it mess up, figured out why, and fixed it.",
        "imageUrl": "",
        "key": "undefined-0c3cc5e2-306f-4680-a231-81a4c98f04fd",
        "layout": "text-bottom-center",
        "typing": true,
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true
      },
      {
        "text": "[SAM]: That's not just an ice cream thing. That's a real job now. People who build and train AI agents do exactly what you did this hour.",
        "imageUrl": "",
        "key": "undefined-5ea2ca70-9731-48d5-8da0-199f0863e0d3",
        "typing": true,
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true,
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      },
      {
        "text": "[SAM]: ...Same time tomorrow? Because I've been thinking. This shop could use an agent for social media. And inventory ordering. And—",
        "imageUrl": "",
        "key": "undefined-8823d531-5f2b-49fe-b76e-6f7a4c0a5204",
        "typing": true,
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true,
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      },
      {
        "text": "[SAM]: Okay okay, go home. But seriously — nice work today.",
        "imageUrl": "",
        "key": "undefined-7b46e7f5-ca1e-4332-a4c3-fba6bd9b9c34",
        "typing": true,
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true,
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      }
    ],
    "use_links": "false"
